    ]
  },
  "entry_sequences": [
    {
      "id": "F.entry.default",
      "when": null,
      "priority": 0,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "F.entry.default.paragraph.01.01",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "珠江在夜色中缓慢流淌。对岸的灯火倒映在水面上——拉成一条条颤动的光带。江风带着水汽和淡淡的腥味拂过沙面的老榕树。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "F.entry.default.paragraph.02.01",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "沙面是珠江边的沙洲小岛，满是殖民时代留下的欧式老建筑。夜晚的沙面安静得不像是广州市中心——除了远处偶尔传来的轮渡汽笛声，只剩下江水拍打石堤的节奏。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "F.entry.default.paragraph.03.01",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "你沿着江边石栏慢慢走。石栏的缝隙里长着青苔——有些石柱是清代的老件，被一百多年的江水冲刷得圆润光滑。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "F.entry.default.paragraph.04.01",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "---",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "F.entry.default.paragraph.05.01",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "在一盏忽明忽暗的路灯下，江边长椅上坐着一个钓鱼的老人。他的鱼竿架在石栏上，鱼线垂入漆黑的江水中。但他没有在看鱼漂——他在看江对面。江对面什么都没有。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "F.entry.default.paragraph.06.01.dialogue",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "水底下有光。",
          "speaker_id": "npc_river_fisher",
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "F.entry.default.paragraph.06.02.narration",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "老人头也不回地说。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "F.entry.default.paragraph.06.03.dialogue",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "很多年了——只有几个人能看到。你能看到吗？",
          "speaker_id": "npc_river_fisher",
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "F.entry.default.paragraph.07.01",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "他转过头。他的眼睛很浑浊——但浑浊深处有一点很亮很亮的光。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "F.entry.default.paragraph.08.01.dialogue",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "我从1650年就在这里钓鱼了。",
          "speaker_id": "npc_river_fisher",
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "F.entry.default.paragraph.08.02.narration",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "他说。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "F.entry.cycle_2",
      "when": "cycle==2",
      "priority": 20,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "F.entry.cycle_2.paragraph.01.01",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "你再次来到珠江边。钓鱼的老人还在——同一个位置，同一根鱼竿。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "F.entry.cycle_2.paragraph.02.01",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "这次你注意到：他的鱼线上没有鱼钩。只有一根线垂入水中——像是在钓什么看不见的东西。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "F.entry.cycle_2.paragraph.03.01.dialogue",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "你又来了。",
          "speaker_id": "npc_river_fisher",
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "F.entry.cycle_2.paragraph.03.02.narration",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "他说。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "F.entry.cycle_2.paragraph.03.03.dialogue",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "大多数人只来一次。你不一样——你还在找。",
          "speaker_id": "npc_river_fisher",
          "when": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "F.entry.cycle_3+",
      "when": "cycle>=3",
      "priority": 30,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "F.entry.cycle_3+.paragraph.01.01",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "第{{cycle_count}}次来到珠江边。钓鱼的老人已经不再介绍自己了——他直接进入正题。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "F.entry.cycle_3+.paragraph.02.01.dialogue",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "text": "江底有一件袈裟——慧觉的。他在1650年冬天把它沉入江中，用来标记时间裂隙的位置。袈裟在水底发光——三百多年了，还在发光。",
          "speaker_id": "npc_river_fisher",
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "F.entry.cycle_3+.paragraph.03.01",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "你看着老人——突然明白了。他不是\"钓鱼人\"。他是陈水生的倒影。真正的陈水生在1650年就已经死了——困在时间裂隙里的人，只能以倒影的形式存在。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
